These DE-language samples were written deliberately to contain prototypical
AI-generated writing tells (AI vocabulary, Nominalstil-Inflation, Konjunktiv II
stacking, formulaic transitions, generic puffery). They function as calibration
anchors for pattern eval per-pattern testing — each sample is engineered to
exercise specific AI tells documented in patterns/de.md.

All samples are original work created for this corpus; no external sources were
copied or paraphrased. Released MIT for downstream use.
